{"id":"n87540-1-7","stage":2,"title":"흥미롭다 · 有趣","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87540-1-7-1","ko":"무슨 신문을 그렇게 열심히 보니?","zh":"你在那么认真地看什么报纸啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"신문을","meaning":"报纸","explanation":"신문：报纸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신문","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65337","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신문을","audio":"/audio/6df29ec2c4ff64e3ac1d.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"보니?","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"bcf27ef578d25dc7","term":"신문","zh":"报纸","au